  "title": "Taqeebaat e Namaz e Isha",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Dua to be recited after Namaz-e-Isha\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّهٗ لَیْسَ لِیْ عِلْمٌ بِمَوْضِعِ رِزْقِی \nALLAAHUMMA INNAHU LAYSA LEE I’LMUN BE MAWZE-E’ RIZQEE \nO Allah! Verily, I lack acquaintance with the place of my sustenance;\nوَ اِنَّمَا اَطْلُبُهٗ بِخَطَرَاتٍ تَخْطُرُ عَلٰی قَلْبِیْ \nWA INNAMAA ATLOBOHU BE-KHATARAATIN TAKHTORO A’LAA QALBEE \nrather, I am seeking it owing to ideas that come upon my mind.\nفَاَجُوْلُ فِیْ طَلَبِهِ الْبُلْدَانَ \nFA-AJOOLO FEE TALABEHIL BULDAANA \nI consequently wander in countries searching for it.\nفَاَنَا فِیْمَآ اَنَا طَالِبٌ كَالْحَیْرَانِ \nFA-ANAA FEEMAA ANAA TAALEBUN KAL HAYRAANE \nBy doing such, I am as confused as the confounded,\nلَا اَدْرِیْ اَفِیْ سَهْلٍ هُوَ اَمْ فِیْ جَبَلٍ \nLAA ADREE A-FEE SAHLIN HOWA AM FEE JABALIN \nsince I do not know whether my sustenance lies in a plain, on a mountain,\nاَمْ فِیْ اَرْضٍ اَمْ فِیْ سَمَآءٍ \nAM FEE ARZIN AM FEE ARZIN AM FEE SAMAAA-IN \non the ground, in the sky,\nاَمْ فِیْ بَرٍّ اَمْ فِیْ بَحْرٍ\nAM FEE BARRIN AM FEE BAHRIN \non lands, in seas,\nوَ عَلٰی یَدَیْ مَنْ وَ مِنْ قِبَلِ مَنْ \nWA A’LAA YADAY MAN WA MIN QEBALE MAN \nat whose hands, or who the source of it is.\nوَ قَدْ عَلِمْتُ اَنَّ عِلْمَهٗ عِنْدَكَ \nWA QAD A’LIMTO ANNA I’LMAHU I’NDAKA \nI have full knowledge that You know all these,\nوَ اَسْبابَهٗ بِیَدِكَ \nWA ASBAABAHU BE-YADEKA \nthe causes of them are in Your Hands,\nوَ اَنْتَ الَّذِیْ تَقْسِمُهٗ بِلُطْفِكَ \nWA ANTAL LAZEE TAQSEMOHU BE-LUTFEKA \nand it is You Who distribute it out of Your compassion\nوَ تُسَبِّبُهٗ بِرَحْمَتِكَ \nWA TOSABBEBOHU BE-RAHMATEKA \nand cause it out of Your mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA FASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI \nO Allah, send blessings on Muhammad and his Household\nوَاجْعَلْ یَا رَبِّ رِزْقَكَ لِیْ وَاسِعًا \nWAJ-A’L YAA RABBE RIZQAKA LEE WAA-SE-A’N \nand make, O Lord, Your sustenance that is provided (by You) to me expansive,\nوَ مَطْلَبَهٗ سَهْلًا وَمَأْخَذَهٗ قَرِیْبًا \nWA MATLABAHU SAHLAN WA MA’KHAZAHU QAREEBAN \nmy seeking for it easy for me, and its source close to me.\nوَ لاَ تُعَنِّنِیْ بِطَلَبِ مَا لَمْ تُقَدِّرْ لِیْ فِیْهِ رِزْقًا\nWA LAA TO-A’NNE-NEE BE TALABE MAA LAM TOQADDIR LEE FEEHE RIZQAN \nDo not fatigue me by seeking that which You have not decided for me to take,\nفَاِنَّكَ غَنِیٌّ عَنْ عَذَابِیْ \nFA-INNAKA GHANIYYUN A’N A’ZAABEE \nbecause You are certainly in no need for tormenting me\nوَ اَنَا فَقِیْرٌ اِلٰی رَحْمَتِكَ \nWA ANAA FAQEERUN ELAA RAHMATEKA \nwhile I am in full need for Your mercy.\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ \nFA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI \nThen send blessings upon Muhammad and his Household\nوَجُدْ عَلٰی عَبْدِكَ بِفَضْلِكَ \nWA JUD A’LAYYA A’BDEKA BE-FAZLEKA \nand confer liberally upon me, Your slave, out of Your graciousness.\nاِنَّكَ ذُوْ فَضْلٍ عَظِیْمٍ.\nINNAKA ZOO FAZLIN A’ZEEMIN.\nYou are surely the Lord of great favor.",
  "tabs": [
    "Another Dua after Namaz-e-Isha\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَعُوْذُ بِعِزَّۃِ اللّٰهِ وَ اَعُوْذُ بِقُدْرَۃِ اللّٰهِ \nA-O’OZO BE I’ZZATILLAAHE, WA A-O’OZO BE QUD-RATILLAAHE \nI seek protection with the Honour of Allah; I seek protection with the Might of Allah\nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِمَغْفِرَۃِ اللّٰهِ وَ اَعُوْذُ بِرَحْمَۃِ اللّٰهِ \nWA A-O’OZO BE MAGHFERATILLAAHE WA A-O’OZO BE RAMATILLAAHE, \nI seek protection with the forgiveness of Allah I seek protection with the mercy of Allah\nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِسُلْطَانِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِیْ ھُوَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٍ \nWA A-O’OZO BE SULTAANILLAAHILLAZEE, HOWA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEER, \nI seek protection with the Authority of Allah who is All Powerful over everything\nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِجَمِیْعِ اللّٰهِ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِیْدٍ وَ سُلْطَانٍ مَرِیْدٍ \nWA A-O’OZO BE KARAMILLAAHE WA A-O’OZO BE JAM-ILLAAHE MIN SHARRE KULLE JABBAARIN A’NEED WASH SHAYTANIM MAREED \nI seek protection with the Grace of Allah: and I seek protection with All-Prevalent Allah from the evil of every insolent tyrant and the despised Devil, \nوَ كُلِّ مُخْتَالٍ وَ سَارِقٍ وَ عَارِضٍ وَ مِنْ شَرِّ السَّامَّۃِ وَ الْحَامَّۃِ وَالْعَامَّۃِ \nWA KULLE MUGHTAALIN WA SAAREQIN WA AAREZIN WA MIN SHARRIS SAAM-MATE VAL HAAM-MATE WAL LAAM-MATE \nevery Killer, thief and every one approaching (to harm); and from the evil of poisonous (animals), Vermin’s and those causing in-jury; \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ دَابَّۃٍ صَغِیْرَۃٍ وَ كَبِیْرَۃٍ بِلَیْلٍ وَ نَھَارٍ \nWA MIN SHARRE KULLE DAAB-BATIN SAGHEERATIN AW KABEERATIN, BE LAYLIN WA NAHAARIN, \nand from the evil of every animal, whether small or big, by night and by day; \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ فُسَّاقِ الْعَرَبِ وَ الْعَجَمِ وَ فُجَّارِھِمْ \nWA MIN SHARRE FUSSAQIL A’RABE WAL A’JAME WA FUJ-JAAREHIM \nand from the evil of the transgressors of Arabs and non-Arabs; and of loose-conduct from among them; \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ فَسَقَۃِ الْجِنِّ وَ الْاِنْسِ \nWA MIN SHARRE FASAQATIL JINNE WAL-INSE, \nand from the evil of the transgressors from among the genil and men; \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ دَابَّۃٍ اَنْتَ آخِذٌ بِنَاصِیَتِھَا \nWA MIN SHARRE KULLE DAABBATIN ANTA AAKHEZOON BE NAASEYATEHAA, \nand from the evil of every animal Thou takest by its fore-lock\nاِنَّ رَبِّیْ عَلٰی صَرَاطٍ مُّسْتَقِیْمٍ.\nINNA RABBI A’LAA SERAATIM MUSTAQEEM.\nindeed my Lord is on the right path."
  ]
